	(text "1. USB-C INPUT + PD SINK (requests 15V)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12 16 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fbfbf5ce-8e81-456d-8f2f-898000ead72a"))
	(text "CC1/CC2 direct to CH224K (internal Rd). DP/DM of CH224K shorted together and NOT\nconnected to the connector (WCH 'PD-only' mode) so USB D+/D- go to the MCU.\nCFG2/CFG3 float = single-resistor mode. CFG1 56k = 15V. PG low = contract OK.\nCH224K VBUS sense pin left NC (allowed in PD-only mode; pin is only 13.5V rated)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14 22.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b8cf96c3-6ba0-446b-976a-d9127fa6be4d"))
	(text "2. 3S CHARGER  BQ25798 (buck-boost, 0x6B)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 202 16 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c6a36c1e-83ea-4331-8380-acaaa988cd8b"))
	(text "PROG 10.5k -> 3S / 1.5MHz: POR defaults VREG=12.6V, ICHG=1A, VSYSMIN=9V.\nNo ACFETs: VAC1/VAC2 tied to VBUS, ACDRV1/2 to GND. ILIM_HIZ->REGN (limit set by I2C).\n/CE held HIGH by 100k -> NO charging until MCU drives CHG_EN high (after cell check).\nBQ25798 D+/D- left open: MCU must clear AUTO_INDET_EN and set IINDPM over I2C.\nTS: 5.23k/30.1k + 10k NTC = 0..60C window (datasheet 7.3.9.5). Shutdown mode = 0.5uA." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 204 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "90802ab3-4b13-444b-a6de-5e52af76c3b4"))
	(text "3. CELL MONITOR/BALANCER  BQ7692003 (0x08)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 402 16 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7c796356-ef76-4575-a7e2-e30b7134ce4e"))
	(text "3S per datasheet Table 9-2: VC5-VC4 = cell3, VC4=VC3=VC2 shorted, VC2-VC1 = cell2, VC1-VC0 = cell1.\nRc=56R / Cc=1uF cell filters -> ~37mA internal balancing (datasheet min Rc 40R, max 50mA) (never balance adjacent cells together).\nSRP/SRN to VSS (no coulomb counter), CHG/DSG unused. Sits in SHIP mode (~0.6uA) when idle.\nBalance lead = SENSE ONLY (charging goes through the Deans main lead), so readings stay accurate." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 404 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eb7d9b66-7b4b-49c3-84e3-5037a6cd1e51"))
	(text "4. MCU POWER (USB / self-hold)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12 166 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dfb57600-2846-44c8-b298-ee6d117892d9"))
	(text "3V3 = OR of: VBUS (charger OR a phone in the USB-C port)  |  battery via Q2 when the MCU\nasserts PWR_HOLD (lets the MCU finish balancing, put BQ25798 in shutdown + BQ76920 in\nSHIP after unplug, then release itself). Nothing else can power the MCU from the pack.\nIdle battery drain ~1-2uA total." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14 172 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4fa357cb-e10c-4135-af01-7d261427eb2a"))
	(text "5. MCU  STM32F042F6P6 (TSSOP-20, USB FS, DFU)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 202 231 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ed1406b8-7c05-47eb-9c97-7708cebbe75f"))
	(text "PF0/PF1 = I2C1 SDA/SCL (AF1). PA11/PA12 remapped onto pins 17/18 for USB (SYSCFG PA11_PA12_RMP).\nPA0 /INT charger, PA1 PD_PG, PA2 CHG_EN, PA3 ALERT, PA4 BMS boot, PA5 VBUS/11 ADC, PA6 LED, PA7 PWR_HOLD.\nPB1 = FAST_CHG_N (JP2 to GND, internal pull-up): open = slow charge (default), bridged = fast charge.\nBridge JP1 + plug USB = ST ROM DFU bootloader. Backup: ST-Link on test pads TP5 SWDIO, TP6 SWCLK, TP7 3V3, TP8 GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 204 237 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b80af3d7-cc77-42f3-b393-a96725fcc261"))
	(text "6. BATTERY + GUN (Deans T-plug pass-through)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 402 231 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ca44c83d-be74-43a8-99dd-386a4dc5f984"))
	(text "Deans pigtail from the battery -> BATT IN pads, Deans pigtail to the gun -> GUN OUT pads.\nPlace each IN/OUT pair side by side and join them with a short, solid copper pour on BOTH\nlayers + stitching vias (or solder both wires to one pad): gun current never crosses the board.\nCharger taps MAIN_P through F1 (3A). Balance plug J2 is sense-only.\nField check: unplug from the gun, plug a phone (USB-C OTG) into the same USB-C port ->\nMCU wakes on the phone's 5V, reports V + % per cell over USB; charges only at 12-17 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 404 318 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4f83f38d-1c93-463e-8689-1c36abe9ce46"))
	(text "H1/H3 (USB-C end): M1.6 (1.7 mm) so heads clear the USB shell. H2/H4: M2 (2.2 mm). Concentric with R3 corners." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 404 360 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5b2db888-7ffd-4088-b446-fb1d4af3dd6f"))
	(text "TP5-TP8: SWD programming / rescue (ST-Link: SWDIO, SWCLK, 3V3, GND) on the back. TP9-TP12: VBUS, BAT, I2C SDA, I2C SCL probe pads." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 404 312 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "726500c1-7dc8-43b7-9007-c58fc6a15cfa"))
